  "definition": "Software Infrastructure comprises the foundational software layers \u2014 including operating systems, middleware, APIs, frameworks, and runtime environments \u2014 that underpin applications and services without being directly user-facing. It provides the shared services, communication channels, and execution contexts on which higher-level metaverse, AI, and distributed-systems applications are built, analogous to the role that physical infrastructure plays for built environments.",
